# The owner's starter-deck workbook: it holds private production notes (prices, bonus cards);
# scripts/starter_decks.py turns it into content/starter-decks.json.
Commander_Duels_Starter_Decks.xlsx

# The owner's folder of files no longer needed, to go through by hand (v0.6.1).
/archive/

# The music (v0.7.2): the owner's tracks, never in the public repository. Locally, music/game.mp3
# beside compose.yaml plays in the Docker stack and the dev server, and since v0.7.3 the menu
# playlist's songs and their manifest, music/playlist.json, beside it; the live site takes them from
# the private web image (docs/deployment.md).
/music/

# The owner's campaign handoff (v0.8.0): the guide and deck builds name the Godlike tier's custom
# cards. content/campaign.json and web/src/campaign/script.ts are made from them (docs/campaign.md).
/campaign/

# The official Comprehensive Rules (v0.8.6): Wizards of the Coast's text, never in the public
# repository. Locally, rules/comprehensive-rules.txt beside compose.yaml is How to play's official
# text in the Docker stack and the dev server; the live site takes it from the private web image
# (docs/how-to-play.md).
/rules/
